(16, 'LEK30', 5, 11, 'LEK30 is a 3 digits thermometer, panel mounted.\r\nA PTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 32 x 74 mm hole in the panel.\r\nSuitable for refrigeration or heating appliances, can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'lek30a.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 32 x74 mm hole. Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'Selectable between:|230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz| 115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz| 24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz| 12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=17mm          ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', '', 'NTC sensor 10k', '', '', '', '', 'Cooling & heating to display the temperature of a cell or a liquid.', 0, NULL, 'LEK30', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'LEK30', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(18, 'LEK32', 5, 11, 'LEK32 is a 3 digits thermometer, panel mounted.\r\nAnalog input allows to display the most common variables: temperature, pressure etc.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel.\r\nSuitable for a wide range of appliances. ', 'lek32.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', '12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz| |', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion)', '', 'selectable between PTC, NTC, PT100, PT1000,  4-20mA (humidity , pressure)', 'two alarm relays 8A max (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Cooling, heating, pressure, humidity.', 0, NULL, 'LEK32', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'LEK32', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(17, 'LEK31', 5, 11, 'LEK31 is a 3 digits thermometer, panel mounted.\r\nA PTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel.\r\nSuitable for refrigeration or heating appliances, can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'lek31.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 		230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', '', 'PTC sensor KTY 88', 'alarm relay 8A max (3 inductive)', '', '', '', 'Cooling & heating to display any temperature.', 0, NULL, 'LEK31', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'LEK31', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(36, 'REK33CHT', 5, 9, 'REK33CHT is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications. Two PTC or NTC sensors allow very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C. Assembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A set of parameters allows the control of the compressor, defrost and fan outputs for a cooling systems up to 1/2 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. It contains a Real Time Clock, so defrost starts can be set with accuracy. Use of capacitive pushbuttons, so that no mechanical parts are present..A special parameter allows to drive a printer for HACCP purposes. ', 'rek33cht-a.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: Cycled by time, by resistor or inverse cycle, stop by evaporator sensor.', '34 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'Compressor: one relay 15A (5A inductive); Defrost: one relay 5A resistive; Fan: one relay 5A resistive', '', '', 'Real Time Clock;                       HACCP;                       Capacitive switches', 'Cooling systems, where defrost must be fast and the cell must be ventilated.', 0, NULL, 'REK33CHT', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK33CHT', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(10, 'LEK21', 5, 11, 'LEK21 is a 3 digits thermometer, panel mounted.\r\nA PTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 31 x 64 mm hole in the panel.\r\nSuitable for refrigeration or heating appliances, can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'lek21a.jpg', ' ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 31 x 64 mm hole panel. Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'Selectable between:| 230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=17mm   ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', '', 'PTC sensor KTY 88', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Cooling & heating to display any temperature.', 0, NULL, 'LEK21', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'LEK21', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(23, 'REK31', 5, 9, 'REK31 is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications.\r\nA PTC or NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a 4 DIN modules housing suitable for an omega clamp. A power set of parameters allows the action for cooling or heating.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/2 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'rek31a.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 		230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', '19 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 15A (5A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Small cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(22, 'TEK41', 5, 11, 'TEK41 is a digital thermostat with 3 digits display, panel mounted, both for cooling and heating applications.\r\nA PTC or NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a 4 DIN modules housing suitable for an omega clamp. A power set of parameters allows the action for cooling or heating.\r\nIt can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'tek41aa.jpg', '4 DIN modules, suitable for an omega clamp', 'selectable between:| 		230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=17mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', '11 parameters', 'PTC KTY81-121 or NTC 10K sensor ', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Heating or cooling systems, working between –50 and +90°C .', 0, NULL, 'TEK41', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'TEK41', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(24, 'REK31E', 5, 9, 'REK31E is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications. A PTC or NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'rek31e-a.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 		230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 		12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: cycled by time, stopping the compressor', '20 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor .', 0, NULL, 'REK31E', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31E', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(25, 'REK31EA', 5, 9, 'REK31EA is a digital controller with 3 digits display, back panel mounted, for cooling applications.\r\nOne NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C for cell. Assembled into an open board, it is suitable for back panel solutions. A fixed set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3HP. The setpoint can be changed by a knob. Suitable for small applications. It can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'rek31ea-a.jpg', 'Open board, need to be installed inside a panel.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor', 'fixed internally', 'NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Small cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31EA', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31EA', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(26, 'REK31ED', 5, 9, 'REK31ED is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications.\r\nTwo PTC or NTC sensor allow very accurate measurements of a temperature between –50 and + 90 °C, both for cell and evaporator.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'rek31ed.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: cycled by time, stopping the compressor, controller by the evaporator sensor', '24 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell and evaporator', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Cooling systems, where defrost is obtained stopping the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31ED', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31ED', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(27, 'REK31EE', 5, 9, 'REK31EE is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications.\r\nOne NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C for cell. Assembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A short set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3HP. Suitable for small applications.\r\nIt can accept the most common power supplies.', 'rek31ee.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: cycled by time, stopping the compressor', '8 parameters', 'NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', '', 'Small cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31EE', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31EE', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(28, 'REK31ET', 5, 9, 'REK31ET is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications. A PTC or NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C. Assembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. Use of capacitive pushbuttons, so no mechanical parts are involved.', 'rek31et.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14 mm 	        	ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: cycled by time, stopping the compressor', '19 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', 'PUSHBUTTONS: capacitive types', 'Cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31ET', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31ET', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(29, 'REK31ETH', 5, 9, 'REK31ETH is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications. A PTC or NTC sensor allows very accurate measurements of a temperature between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost of cooling systems up to 1/3 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. The switches use the capacitive method, so no mechanical parts are involved. A special parameter allows to drive a printer for HACCP purposes. ', 'rek31eth.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14 mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: cycled by time, stopping the compressor', '19 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'one relay 8A (3A inductive)', '', '', 'PUSHBUTTONS: capacitive types 		HACCP: Using parameters n. 28, the controller drives a printer', 'Cooling systems, where defrost is obtained switching off the compressor.', 0, NULL, 'REK31ETH', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK31ETH', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
(30, 'REK32', 5, 9, 'REK32 is a digital controller with 3 digits display, panel mounted, for cooling applications. Two PTC or NTC sensors allow very accurate measurements of temperatures between –50 and + 90 °C.\r\nAssembled inside a housing suitable for 29 x 68 mm hole in the panel. A power set of parameters allows the control of the compressor and defrost outputs of cooling systems up to 1/3 Hp. It can accept the most common power supplies. ', 'rek32.jpg', 'ABS plastic, self extinguishing, suitable for 29x 68 mm hole (32 x 74 mm panel.). Blocked with a plastic clamp.', 'selectable between:| 			230Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			115Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			24Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz | 			12Vac +/-10%, 50-60Hz', '', 'DISPLAY: 3 red LEDs digits, h=14mm 		ACCURACY: +/- 0,5°C (A/D conversion), +/- 1 °C sensor 		DEFROST: Cycled by time, by resistor or inverse cycle, stop by evaporator sensor', '26 parameters', 'PTC sensor KTY120 or NTC 10K for cell', 'the compressor: one relay 8A (3A inductive); Defrost: one relay 5A resistive', '', '', '', 'Cooling systems, where defrost must be fast.', 0, NULL, 'REK32', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'REK32', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL),
